          <a href="#warranty" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Warranty, Protection Plans and Service</a>
          <a href="#compare-specialty" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Best Buy vs a Specialty Fitness Store</a>
